{"id":"n82879-3-7","stage":5,"title":"퇴장 · 退场","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n82879-3-7-1","ko":"어쩌다가 퇴장을 한 거야?","zh":"你怎么会提前退场的啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어쩌다가","meaning":"“어찌하다가(不知怎的)”的缩略语。","explanation":"어쩌다가：“어찌하다가(不知怎的)”的缩略语。","readings":[{"term":"어쩌다가","audio":"/audio/f173c7431a0ab9eefb87.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91976","senseId":"1","lemma":"어쩌다가","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어쩌다가","audio":"/audio/f173c7431a0ab9eefb87.mp3"}},{"text":"퇴장을","meaning":"退场","explanation":"퇴장：退场；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"퇴장","audio":"/audio/68e69c7b9c4cbd3e1079.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82879","senseId":"3","lemma":"퇴장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"퇴장을","audio":"/audio/e54d375d496e40691051.mp3"}},{"text":"한","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"한","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3"}},{"text":"거야?","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거야","audio":"/audio/16592c1618a6826ee403.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"f173c7431a0ab9ee","term":"어쩌다가","zh":"“어찌하다가(不知怎的)”的缩略语。","audio":"/audio/f173c7431a0ab9eefb87.mp3","entryId":"91976","definition":"“어찌하다가(不知怎的)”的缩略语。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"68e69c7b9c4cbd3e","term":"퇴장","zh":"退场","audio":"/audio/68e69c7b9c4cbd3e1079.mp3","entryId":"82879","definition":"在比赛过程中，选手因犯规或受伤等原因而退出场地。","pronunciation":["퇴ː장","퉤ː장"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/b494e381ed72b4bbceb3.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n82879-3-7-2","ko":"경기 중에 발목을 다쳐서 더 뛸 수가 없었어.","zh":"比赛时脚踝受伤了，所以没法继续比赛。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"경기","meaning":"竞技，比赛，竞赛","explanation":"경기：竞技，比赛，竞赛。","readings":[{"term":"경기","audio":"/audio/e56314e9a18b80c16a81.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60094","senseId":"1","lemma":"경기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"경기","audio":"/audio/e56314e9a18b80c16a81.mp3"}},{"text":"중에","meaning":"的时候","explanation":"중：的时候；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"중","audio":"/audio/b558d7af71515538c58a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79404","senseId":"2","lemma":"중","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"중에","audio":"/audio/f0d257645978930f07ec.mp3"}},{"text":"발목을","meaning":"脚脖子，脚踝","explanation":"발목：脚脖子，脚踝；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"발목","audio":"/audio/8bdf6c1c6e18700e7ba6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"56817","senseId":"1","lemma":"발목","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"발목을","audio":"/audio/0545e06cce71fec22055.mp3"}},{"text":"다쳐서","meaning":"受伤，负伤，弄伤","explanation":"다치다：受伤，负伤，弄伤；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"다치다","audio":"/audio/128510caa5a5a0b67924.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73400","senseId":"1","lemma":"다치다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다쳐서","audio":"/audio/2468584acbbe667f00d3.mp3"}},{"text":"더","meaning":"更，更加","explanation":"더：更，更加。","readings":[{"term":"더","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26829","senseId":"2","lemma":"더","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"더","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3"}},{"text":"뛸","meaning":"跑，奔跑","explanation":"뛰다：跑，奔跑；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"뛰다","audio":"/audio/96e5ecf6b0d33341a17f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74124","senseId":"1","lemma":"뛰다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뛸","audio":"/audio/ec290513e0390276333f.mp3"}},{"text":"수가","meaning":"可以，可能","explanation":"수：可以，可能；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15615","senseId":"1","lemma":"수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"수가","audio":"/audio/6780a417c9a853af476b.mp3"}},{"text":"없었어.","meaning":"不能（-ㄹ/을 수 없다）","explanation":"없다：不能（-ㄹ/을 수 없다）；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"11","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"없었어","audio":"/audio/878f405278d830a29ede.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"e56314e9a18b80c1","term":"경기","zh":"竞技，比赛，竞赛","audio":"/audio/e56314e9a18b80c16a81.mp3","entryId":"60094","definition":"互相比较运动或技术等的能力。","pronunciation":["경ː기"]},{"id":"b558d7af71515538","term":"중","zh":"的时候","audio":"/audio/b558d7af71515538c58a.mp3","entryId":"79404","definition":"在做某事的期间。","pronunciation":["중"]},{"id":"8bdf6c1c6e18700e","term":"발목","zh":"脚脖子，脚踝","audio":"/audio/8bdf6c1c6e18700e7ba6.mp3","entryId":"56817","definition":"腿和脚连接的部位。","pronunciation":["발목"]},{"id":"128510caa5a5a0b6","term":"다치다","zh":"受伤，负伤，弄伤","audio":"/audio/128510caa5a5a0b67924.mp3","entryId":"73400","definition":"被撞到或被打后身上或身体的一部分出现伤口；或指使出现伤口。","pronunciation":["다치다"]},{"id":"1e2cb79b6970d021","term":"더","zh":"更，更加","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3","entryId":"26829","definition":"与比较对象或某个标准相比，程度加深；在那之上。","pronunciation":["더"]},{"id":"96e5ecf6b0d33341","term":"뛰다","zh":"跑，奔跑","audio":"/audio/96e5ecf6b0d33341a17f.mp3","entryId":"74124","definition":"快速挪动双脚，迅速向前行进。","pronunciation":["뛰다"]},{"id":"dcd19f5b5caac977","term":"수","zh":"可以，可能","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3","entryId":"15615","definition":"做某事的能力，或某事发生的可能性。","pronunciation":["수"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"不能（-ㄹ/을 수 없다）","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"不能（-ㄹ/을 수 없다）","pronunciation":["업ː따"]}],"audio":"/audio/f4cc2e114889cf0abe15.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.47,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=82879","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"3","sourceLevel":"고급","day":161,"sequenceScore":3.1953,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["比赛时脚踝受伤了，所以没法继续比赛。","你怎么会提前退场的啊？","灯开了也不亮啊。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["你怎么会提前退场的啊？","灯开了也不亮啊。","比赛时脚踝受伤了，所以没法继续比赛。"],"answer":2}]}
